WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.510 --> 01:40.540
This isn't a threat.

01:40.920 --> 01:42.930
I'm asking the Three Sects
to unite against this crisis.

01:43.150 --> 01:44.210
The Three Sects unite?

01:44.680 --> 01:46.130
Are you kidding me?

01:46.950 --> 01:47.900
See for yourself.

01:48.000 --> 01:49.290
Those Seizing Sect disciples
down there...

01:49.640 --> 01:51.180
They're all puppets of demonic arts.

01:51.640 --> 01:52.460
You're an Aureate Immortal.

01:52.480 --> 01:53.540
Can't you see it?

01:53.560 --> 01:54.980
Of course I can.

01:55.000 --> 01:56.050
Today, the Seizing Sect
attacks the Human Sect.

01:56.760 --> 01:57.690
And tomorrow?

01:58.000 --> 01:59.410
The Elucidating Sect
attacks the Seizing Sect?

01:59.590 --> 02:00.900
And the Human Sect
attacks the Elucidating Sect?

02:01.310 --> 02:02.490
This vicious cycle repeats endlessly.

02:02.840 --> 02:05.490
Is this really the Way
your mentor seeks?

02:05.510 --> 02:06.050
You...

02:06.710 --> 02:07.260
You...

02:07.590 --> 02:08.820
Right now, there's a force

02:09.240 --> 02:10.660
that's the common enemy
of the Three Sects.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.610
Their goal

02:11.630 --> 02:13.220
is to make the Three Sects
tear each other apart.

02:13.520 --> 02:15.660
Are you gonna wait
until the enemy bares their fangs

02:15.680 --> 02:17.850
to regret standing by today?

02:17.870 --> 02:18.610
Changgeng...

02:19.080 --> 02:20.730
What exactly is he trying to do?

02:26.750 --> 02:27.980
He needs to learn to trust.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.170
Mentor.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.340
Mentor.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.850
My spiritual power is back.

03:24.870 --> 03:25.380
Oh no.

03:25.870 --> 03:27.570
The Pregenesis Sword
left the Ascendance Sect.

03:28.240 --> 03:28.820
Changgeng.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.820
What trick did you play?

03:33.560 --> 03:34.690
My turn.

03:41.120 --> 03:41.890
No more pretending.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.570
Sea-Calming Pearls.

03:53.080 --> 03:54.340
Sea-Calming Pearls?

03:54.800 --> 03:56.060
Kill!

04:03.560 --> 04:04.700
You're Zhao Gongming?

04:05.640 --> 04:06.890
Kill.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.980
Kill.

04:18.440 --> 04:19.690
Kill.

04:31.230 --> 04:32.490
Kill...

04:35.710 --> 04:37.330
Kill...

04:55.630 --> 04:56.730
My fellow disciples,

04:59.190 --> 05:00.460
this disaster

05:02.310 --> 05:04.370
is my debt. Zhao Gongming owes you all.

05:05.830 --> 05:06.610
In the next life,

05:08.040 --> 05:11.490
we shall drink and be merry again.

05:12.680 --> 05:13.540
Next life.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.900
[Episode 21]

05:25.270 --> 05:26.610
Pregenesis Sword.

05:28.270 --> 05:29.850
Pregenesis Sword.

06:03.430 --> 06:05.220
Pregenesis Sword.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.220
Sorry...

06:27.240 --> 06:28.490
Take the Pregenesis Sword.

06:31.510 --> 06:32.660
For my rudeness.

07:09.630 --> 07:11.100
What is this?

07:11.680 --> 07:12.700
Why did Changgeng

07:13.720 --> 07:15.020
tell me to protect it?

07:29.750 --> 07:30.930
Ke Le'er.

07:31.950 --> 07:34.170
Why are you still in boys' clothes?

07:34.190 --> 07:35.810
I am a man.

07:36.310 --> 07:37.460
You're a man?

07:41.950 --> 07:42.730
Stop it.

07:43.390 --> 07:44.170
Let's get to the point.

07:44.310 --> 07:45.340
Do you still remember

07:45.360 --> 07:47.100
what the Grandlord
of the Sea Deity Sect taught you?

07:47.120 --> 07:47.780
We do.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.810
Trust the Sea Deity, get great power.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.170
Do you still believe
in the Sea Deity Sect?

07:51.360 --> 07:51.810
We do.

07:51.920 --> 07:52.490
Good.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.410
Then follow me and fight our way back.

07:53.430 --> 07:55.020
Prove your strength to the Grandlord.

07:55.040 --> 07:55.610
Yes.

07:55.750 --> 07:56.170
Let's go.

07:56.190 --> 07:56.980
Your Highness.

08:00.160 --> 08:00.980
Your Highness.

08:01.160 --> 08:03.290
The Pearl Elites will aid you.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.140
Si'er?

08:06.560 --> 08:08.250
Seeing you turn into a golden dragon,

08:08.270 --> 08:09.490
I see the truth clearly now.

08:09.510 --> 08:11.290
Our Mermaid Clan will follow you

08:11.480 --> 08:13.460
to return to the East Sea
and revive the Dragon Clan.

08:17.270 --> 08:17.900
Senior.

08:18.430 --> 08:19.660
I swear I'll find you.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.850
Mentor. Uncle.

08:24.950 --> 08:25.730
Mentor.

08:47.360 --> 08:48.820
What a pity.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.700
If he could've worked for me,

08:52.200 --> 08:54.130
it wouldn't have come to this.

09:08.720 --> 09:11.060
Jade Division truly is poor.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.700
Not even some decent tea.

09:19.030 --> 09:20.610
Your mentor is dumb.

09:20.720 --> 09:22.060
Your uncle is dumb.

09:22.080 --> 09:23.100
And you are dumb, too.

09:23.360 --> 09:24.890
You already escaped.

09:24.910 --> 09:27.100
But you came back just to die.

09:27.720 --> 09:31.700
I never thought my carefully laid plan

09:31.720 --> 09:35.460
was foiled at the cost of your life.

09:36.670 --> 09:40.060
Guess Qi Yuan taught you well.

09:40.270 --> 09:43.100
Good thing Jiu Wu is already dead.

09:43.440 --> 09:44.700
Next,

09:46.000 --> 09:48.460
I just need to get rid of you.

09:48.870 --> 09:52.180
Then no one will know my true identity.

09:52.440 --> 09:55.770
I'll remain an Elder
of the Ascendance Sect.

09:55.790 --> 09:58.300
With merit for defending the sect.

09:58.840 --> 10:01.610
Whatever scheme I plan next,

10:01.720 --> 10:04.220
no one can stop me.

10:04.270 --> 10:06.850
Other way around, Elder Kuai.

10:06.910 --> 10:07.940
I'm the one

10:09.480 --> 10:11.180
who finally gets to kill you.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.420
Kill me?

10:18.240 --> 10:20.650
You're only an Ascension Stage disciple.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.300
What can you do to me?

10:38.030 --> 10:38.850
Li Changshou.

10:38.910 --> 10:40.300
How'd you get so strong?

10:40.510 --> 10:41.700
This is Jade Division.

10:42.270 --> 10:43.530
My turf.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.770
How could this be?

10:59.910 --> 11:02.890
I sealed the vital point on your body.

11:03.030 --> 11:04.700
You can't use spiritual power now.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.180
You couldn't even tell?

11:06.720 --> 11:08.730
How did you ever
become an Aureate Immortal?

11:16.790 --> 11:18.890
I knew you were the mole all along.

11:20.320 --> 11:21.850
I just never made a move.

11:22.790 --> 11:23.820
If I wanted to,

11:24.120 --> 11:26.100
I could have killed you anytime.

11:26.270 --> 11:27.100
I could even

11:27.390 --> 11:30.100
choose how and when you die.

11:30.270 --> 11:33.130
And how long you'd suffer before dying.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.490
It was my fault.

11:36.910 --> 11:38.530
My constant indulgence

11:38.870 --> 11:40.100
and evasion

11:40.550 --> 11:42.490
that led to today's tragedy.

11:44.840 --> 11:45.820
So,

11:47.720 --> 11:50.060
I've decided to end your life.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.300
How could this be?

12:09.550 --> 12:11.250
When Cloudlink Hermit
came to the Ascendance Sect,

12:11.600 --> 12:13.850
he only bowed to Detached Master.

12:13.870 --> 12:15.890
Cloudlink Hermit only
respects Aureate Immortals.

12:15.910 --> 12:17.890
So why didn't he bow to you?

12:18.150 --> 12:19.650
Because he saw right through you.

12:21.000 --> 12:23.130
You used someone else's power
for your Tribulation.

12:23.600 --> 12:25.340
You're not a real Aureate Immortal.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.100
I am an Aureate Immortal!

12:27.320 --> 12:28.580
I am one!

12:29.120 --> 12:30.770
I've sealed all your vitals.

12:31.510 --> 12:33.370
Your demonic power is draining away too.

12:33.910 --> 12:34.530
Take a guess.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.300
Why that is.

12:38.600 --> 12:39.370
Why?

12:39.960 --> 12:40.850
Elder Kuai.

12:41.750 --> 12:43.100
Don't you want

12:43.390 --> 12:44.890
to properly undergo a tribulation

12:45.150 --> 12:46.890
and be a real Aureate Immortal?

12:48.750 --> 12:50.420
I'm making your dream come true.

12:53.910 --> 12:54.770
What is this?

12:56.000 --> 12:57.370
This is Elucidating's Treasure Pearl.

12:57.510 --> 12:58.820
It holds a thousand years
of spiritual power.

12:59.960 --> 13:01.530
I bet you want it.

13:17.150 --> 13:17.980
Elder Kuai.

13:18.390 --> 13:19.370
You know what?

13:20.360 --> 13:22.770
A Tribulation is extremely dangerous

13:22.790 --> 13:24.220
for cultivators.

13:24.670 --> 13:26.220
You must handle it carefully.

13:26.550 --> 13:28.300
But your vitals are all sealed.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.650
And you can't use spiritual power.

13:29.750 --> 13:31.340
When that lightning strikes down,

13:32.000 --> 13:33.530
it's going to hurt like hell.

13:35.550 --> 13:36.490
During my last Tribulation,

13:36.510 --> 13:37.980
I noticed something.

13:38.030 --> 13:40.340
The items you carry in tribulation

13:40.510 --> 13:41.730
may affect

13:41.750 --> 13:44.490
Fate's judgment of your cultivation.

13:44.720 --> 13:46.340
It may even give you

13:46.390 --> 13:47.940
a tribulation not meant for you.

13:48.200 --> 13:49.580
I was afraid you'd be cold.

13:50.320 --> 13:52.460
So I got you an Aureate Immortal's robe.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.490
Changshou, I'm sorry.

13:55.750 --> 13:57.610
Please let me go, Changshou.

13:57.750 --> 13:58.530
It's all my fault.

13:58.790 --> 14:00.580
For the sake of our sect ties...

14:00.600 --> 14:02.180
Forgive me.

14:04.870 --> 14:07.130
My dear Uncle, as your junior...

14:07.790 --> 14:10.700
I picked the biggest Tribulation
for you.

14:11.240 --> 14:11.650
No.

14:11.960 --> 14:12.890
Enjoy it.

14:44.670 --> 14:45.700
Gourd, help me.

14:52.910 --> 14:53.700
Hello.

14:54.390 --> 14:54.850
Thank you.

14:55.550 --> 14:56.370
Reversal Cudgel.

14:57.600 --> 14:58.460
How can this be?

15:22.960 --> 15:23.730
A Deity.

15:23.900 --> 15:27.500
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

15:29.270 --> 15:30.130
Mentor.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.890
Who is that?

15:32.750 --> 15:33.300
That's...

15:33.790 --> 15:35.010
Grand Mage of Voidcity.

15:35.010 --> 15:37.140
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

15:37.230 --> 15:39.800
♪Put on a good show♪

15:39.980 --> 15:44.630
♪Why not change forms and play♪

15:46.270 --> 15:48.700
The thousand-year karmic debt...

15:49.870 --> 15:53.970
♪Caught in karma, stained by dust♪

15:55.160 --> 15:56.980
♪Say you're carefree♪

15:56.980 --> 16:00.810
♪Yet still explore this fate♪

16:02.390 --> 16:03.700
Beans into Soldiers.

16:05.000 --> 16:08.140
♪In days to come, be God or Demon♪

16:08.140 --> 16:10.590
♪Let them all come♪

16:10.590 --> 16:14.490
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

16:14.650 --> 16:16.680
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

16:17.290 --> 16:19.450
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

16:19.780 --> 16:24.450
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

16:24.800 --> 16:26.810
♪Who plots and schemes♪

16:27.490 --> 16:29.340
♪And set formations in the world♪

16:29.950 --> 16:36.400
♪I will go in and stir things up♪

16:55.240 --> 16:56.130
So powerful.

16:57.460 --> 16:58.080
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

16:58.080 --> 16:59.610
He's the Human Sect's top disciple.

17:00.200 --> 17:02.180
A thousand years ago, he alone

17:02.200 --> 17:03.890
brought down the Demon Clan.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.220
I am Voidcity.

17:15.270 --> 17:17.530
Top disciple of Lord Pureheaven.

17:19.200 --> 17:20.330
Grand Mage of Voidcity?

17:21.480 --> 17:22.660
What? Do you know him?

17:22.680 --> 17:23.330
Not really.

17:24.720 --> 17:26.180
Then why are you wowing?

17:46.350 --> 17:49.180
He actually introduced himself to me.

17:49.750 --> 17:50.730
Is she smiling at you?

17:51.160 --> 17:52.010
You know her?

17:52.350 --> 17:53.140
Not really.

18:07.350 --> 18:08.420
Voidcity.

18:10.030 --> 18:11.940
I'll make you remember

18:15.480 --> 18:16.530
who I am.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.090
You are

18:28.440 --> 18:29.660
Little Gnat?

18:33.240 --> 18:34.940
Oh no. They seem to know each other.

18:34.960 --> 18:35.940
They're in cahoots?

18:40.480 --> 18:41.250
This is

18:42.550 --> 18:44.050
my karma.

19:03.440 --> 19:04.460
Die!

19:04.480 --> 19:05.250
Don't.

19:17.200 --> 19:17.730
Freeze.

19:24.480 --> 19:25.380
Where is this?

19:36.590 --> 19:37.860
Grand Mage of Voidcity.

19:50.550 --> 19:52.250
Your journey here

19:52.880 --> 19:54.180
must have been hard.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.420
I won't hurt you.

19:58.480 --> 19:59.250
Go.

20:09.590 --> 20:10.380
What?

20:11.440 --> 20:12.090
Not leaving?

20:16.590 --> 20:18.460
The Mortal Realm...

20:19.480 --> 20:20.810
Is too dangerous for you.

20:21.440 --> 20:22.620
Your coming here

20:23.350 --> 20:24.530
is destiny

20:25.160 --> 20:26.420
and karma.

20:32.880 --> 20:33.660
Alright.

20:34.750 --> 20:36.140
You can follow me from now on.

20:40.880 --> 20:43.290
That's Grand Mage of Voidcity's blood.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.860
Every drop
holds a century of cultivation.

21:30.960 --> 21:31.730
Look.

21:33.070 --> 21:34.180
This world

21:34.880 --> 21:35.980
is so beautiful.

21:59.160 --> 21:59.940
Perhaps...

22:01.160 --> 22:03.140
This is human-gnat empathy.

22:05.070 --> 22:06.570
It looks quite touching.

22:31.340 --> 22:34.020
[Blood Sea]

22:34.030 --> 22:34.940
Voidcity.

22:35.640 --> 22:36.980
You killed my people.

22:37.270 --> 22:38.810
[Blood Gnat Demon]
I'll end you!

22:39.160 --> 22:40.730
I killed your people?

22:42.270 --> 22:44.290
How many human lives have you taken?

22:44.590 --> 22:46.220
In this Great Tribulation,

22:47.160 --> 22:49.620
we were just two pawns.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.290
Between us,

22:52.590 --> 22:54.490
there is only mutual slaughter.

22:55.270 --> 22:56.620
Until one side

22:57.110 --> 22:58.730
is wiped out.

23:00.110 --> 23:01.140
I'm sorry.

23:01.350 --> 23:01.940
No!

23:02.200 --> 23:02.980
No!

23:07.720 --> 23:09.980
No!

23:37.200 --> 23:37.770
Are you

23:40.480 --> 23:41.730
going to kill me?

23:45.920 --> 23:46.980
You're a deity.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.810
I'm a demon.

23:51.000 --> 23:51.730
We...

23:52.000 --> 23:54.420
We have always been sworn foes.

23:56.310 --> 23:57.730
We are enemies.

23:58.400 --> 24:00.010
If you let me go today,

24:00.520 --> 24:02.660
all you've done to us,

24:03.000 --> 24:06.930
I'll repay you a hundredfold.

24:08.790 --> 24:11.060
I'll kill all your people.

24:11.150 --> 24:12.900
I'll destroy your sect.

24:13.880 --> 24:16.180
I'll make you regret it for life.

24:52.440 --> 24:53.250
Where is this?

24:54.590 --> 24:56.140
The thousand-year karmic debt

24:56.750 --> 24:58.660
is inescapable after all.

24:59.350 --> 25:00.380
Grand Mage of Voidcity.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.090
Ascendance Sect disciple Li Changshou

25:02.110 --> 25:03.460
greets the Grand Mage of Voidcity.

25:03.750 --> 25:04.530
Li Changshou.

25:05.750 --> 25:06.770
Not Changgeng?

25:08.160 --> 25:10.330
Changgeng is just my fake identity.

25:10.350 --> 25:12.530
I dare not play tricks before you.

25:12.750 --> 25:13.810
I see.

25:14.880 --> 25:16.530
I boldly ask.

25:17.070 --> 25:18.250
What I just saw...

25:18.640 --> 25:20.050
Was it your memory?

25:27.960 --> 25:28.730
Come with me.

25:43.550 --> 25:44.460
So,

25:45.110 --> 25:46.460
you knew that demon long ago?

25:47.590 --> 25:48.010
Yes.

25:51.350 --> 25:52.250
Did you

25:53.160 --> 25:54.290
wipe out her clan?

25:57.550 --> 25:58.330
Yes.

25:59.960 --> 26:01.330
A thousand years have passed.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.980
I can barely recall it now.

26:11.750 --> 26:12.530
It's her.

26:13.270 --> 26:14.290
This demon

26:14.720 --> 26:16.940
manipulated Elder Kuai Si

26:17.070 --> 26:18.330
into attacking his own sect,

26:18.640 --> 26:20.380
leaving countless disciples dead.

26:20.400 --> 26:21.050
She is

26:21.550 --> 26:22.620
called Wen Jing.

26:30.160 --> 26:31.460
She is a blood gnat,

26:31.960 --> 26:34.010
born in the Blood Sea.

26:34.640 --> 26:36.980
Her kind have lived there
for generations,

26:37.240 --> 26:39.330
feeding on its blood

26:40.270 --> 26:42.620
and keeping to themselves.

26:44.160 --> 26:45.700
For the Blood Gnat Clan,

26:46.920 --> 26:49.140
nothing matters more
than their own kind.

26:49.640 --> 26:52.730
A gnat without its swarm

26:53.310 --> 26:55.490
is pitifully insignificant.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.090
But I

26:58.510 --> 27:01.620
almost wiped out her entire clan.

27:11.920 --> 27:14.620
All her sins are because of me.

27:16.270 --> 27:17.730
She is my karmic debt.

27:18.160 --> 27:19.330
My consequence to bear.

27:22.030 --> 27:23.250
The few clansmen she has left

27:23.270 --> 27:25.420
are all imprisoned in the Blood Sea.

27:25.960 --> 27:28.250
Someone threatens her with their lives.

27:28.880 --> 27:30.420
She was never evil at heart.

27:30.750 --> 27:33.460
She only fell so low to save her clan.

27:35.000 --> 27:35.860
Li Changshou.

27:37.680 --> 27:39.180
I'm asking you to let her go.

27:40.240 --> 27:41.250
Do you agree?

27:45.400 --> 27:46.810
Grand Mage, do you know

27:48.000 --> 27:49.380
what she has done?

27:51.160 --> 27:52.090
Mentor Qi Yuan.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.330
Aunt Wan Jiangyu.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.380
Uncle Jiu Wu...

27:55.400 --> 27:56.050
I know.

28:01.480 --> 28:02.490
Changshou.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.220
Let her go.

28:12.830 --> 28:13.660
Can you?

29:36.240 --> 29:37.010
Kuai Si.

29:42.620 --> 29:44.300
[Jade Division]

29:47.550 --> 29:50.180
Do you know what you are doing?

29:54.070 --> 29:54.900
Detached Master

29:57.070 --> 29:58.250
is dead?

30:01.160 --> 30:02.570
You colluded with the Demon Clan,

30:03.480 --> 30:04.940
killed the Grandlord,

30:06.400 --> 30:08.010
and destroyed the Ascendance Sect.

30:09.160 --> 30:09.770
I...

30:11.640 --> 30:12.940
destroyed the Ascendance Sect?

30:14.750 --> 30:16.140
Now in the Ascendance Sect,

30:17.880 --> 30:19.700
only you and I are left.

30:20.110 --> 30:22.730
How will you pay for this sin?

30:32.200 --> 30:33.730
So that's how it is.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.700
That demon saved me.

30:51.680 --> 30:52.940
I won.

30:53.550 --> 30:55.730
Decades of silent endurance.

30:55.960 --> 30:57.940
I've finally seen this day.

30:58.110 --> 30:58.900
Detached Master.

30:59.350 --> 31:01.290
I finally defeated you.

31:01.750 --> 31:03.010
Do you know

31:03.400 --> 31:05.420
how long I've waited

31:05.440 --> 31:06.730
for this day?

31:07.550 --> 31:09.770
Ascendance Sect is no longer yours.

31:10.510 --> 31:12.140
It's mine.

31:12.160 --> 31:13.530
It belongs to Kuai Si!

31:14.000 --> 31:16.380
You didn't win. You're crazy.

31:18.160 --> 31:20.090
Ascendance Sect is gone.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.530
Ascendance Sect is gone?

31:30.350 --> 31:31.980
Isn't it all still here?

31:33.070 --> 31:34.730
Look at the mountains, the land,

31:34.750 --> 31:36.290
and the plants and dirt.

31:36.350 --> 31:37.660
Aren't they all still here?

31:38.830 --> 31:39.980
And look at me.

31:40.640 --> 31:42.900
Aren't I still alive and well?

31:43.720 --> 31:45.570
What are you talking about?

31:59.240 --> 32:00.940
From this day forward,

32:02.440 --> 32:03.810
I, Kuai Si,

32:04.550 --> 32:09.530
am the Founding Patriarch
of the new Ascendance Sect.

32:15.640 --> 32:18.010
You betrayed the sect and ancestors.

32:18.550 --> 32:20.490
I aided the Westdawn Sect.

32:21.680 --> 32:24.980
They will surely
help me rebuild the sect.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.140
Westdawn Sect?

32:28.550 --> 32:29.420
Right.

32:30.310 --> 32:31.980
Westdawn Sect.

32:34.110 --> 32:35.250
This attack on the mountain...

32:36.750 --> 32:39.490
Wasn't the Great Tribulation
caused by the Seizing Sect

32:40.640 --> 32:42.700
conspiring with the Demon Clan?

32:45.720 --> 32:46.940
Seizing Sect?

32:48.550 --> 32:49.770
Demon Clan?

32:51.000 --> 32:52.050
What are they?

32:53.030 --> 32:55.050
Just pawns in my hands.

32:55.790 --> 32:57.330
From the very beginning...

32:57.350 --> 32:58.530
From the very beginning,

32:58.550 --> 32:59.530
it was me, Kuai Si,

32:59.550 --> 33:01.730
controlling the whole Ascendance Sect.

33:03.310 --> 33:04.420
Detached Master

33:04.440 --> 33:05.380
didn't know the times

33:05.400 --> 33:07.250
or see the big picture.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.730
But I'm different.

33:09.960 --> 33:12.250
With Westdawn's support,

33:13.550 --> 33:15.810
the Ascendance Sect in my hands

33:16.110 --> 33:19.180
will surely become the greatest sect.

33:28.350 --> 33:31.050
The Three Sects won't just stand by.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.730
Of course they won't.

33:39.880 --> 33:41.330
But what a pity.

33:42.200 --> 33:45.620
By that time, they'll be powerless

33:46.160 --> 33:48.530
to stop Westdawn anymore.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.620
Senior,

33:50.920 --> 33:53.860
since you're about to die anyway,

33:54.030 --> 33:56.290
I might as well tell you.

33:56.590 --> 33:57.570
The Westdawn Sect's

33:58.480 --> 34:01.220
about to open the Eye of the East Sea.

34:01.920 --> 34:05.940
This will be a Great Tribulation.

34:07.550 --> 34:09.090
All beings of the Three Sects,

34:09.590 --> 34:10.980
barely one in ten will survive.

34:13.440 --> 34:15.490
After the catastrophe,

34:16.760 --> 34:18.820
if Westdawn strikes,

34:18.840 --> 34:21.340
who can stop them?

34:22.550 --> 34:23.260
Right.

34:27.230 --> 34:30.210
Great Tribulation.

34:33.920 --> 34:35.010
Senior.

34:37.590 --> 34:38.900
Seeing that you've

34:39.920 --> 34:41.900
had a hard life,

34:42.190 --> 34:42.980
how about

34:43.800 --> 34:44.860
I send you off early

34:44.880 --> 34:47.090
to reunite with Wan Jiangyu?

34:48.150 --> 34:48.940
That way,

34:49.320 --> 34:52.130
you can avoid this Great Tribulation.

34:55.000 --> 34:55.780
Sounds good?

35:02.510 --> 35:04.980
I hate you the most.

35:17.230 --> 35:18.090
Detached Master?

35:25.360 --> 35:26.130
Grandlord.

35:32.550 --> 35:33.530
Fellow cultivators.

35:35.190 --> 35:36.210
Now,

35:36.510 --> 35:37.900
the truth is out, right?

35:40.510 --> 35:41.490
I'll take my leave.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.300
Detached Master.

35:55.320 --> 35:57.650
I am also an Aureate Immortal.

35:58.190 --> 35:59.900
You want to kill me?

36:00.590 --> 36:02.460
It won't be that easy.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.090
Your opponent

36:04.590 --> 36:05.420
isn't me.

36:12.710 --> 36:13.780
Qi Yuan?

36:18.510 --> 36:20.530
You harmed the Ascendance Sect.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.740
It was me.

36:25.230 --> 36:27.570
You ruined my foundation.

36:27.590 --> 36:28.610
It was me.

36:28.760 --> 36:32.090
You killed my Senior Wan Jiangyu.

36:33.840 --> 36:35.380
Also me.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.690
Qi Yuan.

36:41.550 --> 36:43.740
You're just trash
with a ruined foundation.

36:43.840 --> 36:45.530
What can you do to me?

36:50.920 --> 36:53.340
Everyone, follow me out.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.860
It's going to get bloody here.

36:59.920 --> 37:01.300
Senior. Mentor.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.170
Let's go.

37:18.590 --> 37:19.340
Kuai Si.

37:21.320 --> 37:23.340
Your foundation was destroyed
by the lightning.

37:23.880 --> 37:25.050
Remember?

37:35.590 --> 37:37.420
You harmed the Ascendance Sect.

37:38.550 --> 37:40.010
Ruined my foundation.

37:41.960 --> 37:43.610
Killed my Senior.

37:44.400 --> 37:47.260
It was me. All me.

38:00.710 --> 38:02.490
You harmed the Ascendance Sect.

38:03.630 --> 38:05.050
Ruined my foundation.

38:05.150 --> 38:07.740
- Killed my Senior.
- Grandlord, save me!

38:07.760 --> 38:09.490
You killed my Senior.

38:09.510 --> 38:12.590
- Senior, I'm sorry.
- You killed my Senior!

38:12.590 --> 38:14.490
Senior, it was all my fault.

38:14.510 --> 38:16.380
You killed my Senior!

38:22.800 --> 38:24.170
You're on your own.

38:24.340 --> 38:33.580
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

38:42.630 --> 38:45.690
Jiu Wu saw through Kuai Si's trick.

38:46.070 --> 38:47.980
He went to Jade Division alone,

38:49.110 --> 38:50.530
broke the formation with his life,

38:50.960 --> 38:52.570
and got your magical power back

38:53.030 --> 38:54.490
to defend the sect.

39:02.110 --> 39:02.650
Jiu Wu.

39:03.670 --> 39:04.900
You didn't let me down.

39:06.230 --> 39:09.170
Jiu Jiu, neither did you.

39:12.400 --> 39:14.490
Back then, my mind was fading.

39:16.480 --> 39:19.940
I could only entrust this to you two.

39:20.760 --> 39:21.530
Both of you

39:23.480 --> 39:26.650
truly united the Three Sects.

39:28.630 --> 39:30.610
I'm very proud.

39:32.840 --> 39:33.610
Senior.

39:38.960 --> 39:39.740
Senior.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.530
Is it because

39:41.880 --> 39:43.740
I didn't urge Aunt Jiu Jiu to go?

39:44.150 --> 39:44.900
That he...

39:46.920 --> 39:47.740
I'm sorry.

39:48.230 --> 39:49.260
It wasn't your fault.

39:51.630 --> 39:53.300
Mentor was worried about us.

39:54.590 --> 39:56.610
So he had Uncle Jiu Wu look after us.

39:59.740 --> 40:02.170
♪Past fragments♪

40:03.000 --> 40:05.460
You can never calculate the human heart.

40:41.370 --> 40:47.150
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

40:47.820 --> 40:54.520
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

40:56.050 --> 41:02.100
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

41:02.730 --> 41:09.180
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

41:09.920 --> 41:17.040
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:17.420 --> 41:24.320
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:24.700 --> 41:32.050
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

41:32.050 --> 41:39.220
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

41:55.360 --> 42:00.530
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

42:01.620 --> 42:08.640
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

42:09.830 --> 42:15.770
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

42:16.470 --> 42:23.550
♪Alas, our story is short♪

42:23.890 --> 42:31.000
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:31.320 --> 42:37.800
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:38.580 --> 42:45.790
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:46.180 --> 42:54.000
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
